at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2029-12-31 17:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2039-12-31 17:00:00</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Starts in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action"><button data-href="/jam/327850/join" class="button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn" data-method="post">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h2 class="text-center">Click &quot;Join jam&quot; to subscribe!</h2>
<blockquote class="text-center"><em><strong>We won&#x27;t send you any spam,</strong> you&#x27;ll only hear from us once every couple of months when there is a new jam or when a compilation album is out. To unsubscribe, simply leave the jam. Happy composing!<br></em></blockquote>
<hr>
<h3 class="text-center">About OST Composing Jam:</h3>
<p class="text-center">OST Composing Jam is an online music competition where musicians and composers all around the globe are challenged to compose an original soundtrack of any style for an imaginary game, in just a little over than a week, based on a given theme.</p>
<p class="text-center"><a href="https://ostcompjam.alonerabbit.com" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Homepage</a> | <a href="https://itch.io/jams/hosted-by-lonerabbit" target="_blank">Past Jams</a> | <a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/0F31RkhxH0HhkdOUa3INQW" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Listen</a></p>
<p class="text-center"><iframe style="" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/4tFpzWLdTfkMoOb3C340Ry?utm_source=generator" width="50%" height="152" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></p>
<hr>
<p class="text-center"><strong>Hosted by&nbsp;<a href="https://lonerabbit.itch.io/">Lone Rabbit</a>&nbsp;·&nbsp;</strong><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/OSTCompJam" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><strong>#OSTCompJam</strong></a><br></p>
<p class="text-center"><a href="https://discord.gg/NqDAxMk" target="_blank" style="" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzY2MzM1ODgucG5n/original/KyrBgm.png" width="200" alt="Discord" title="Discord" loading="lazy"></a></p>
<h4 class="text-center"><a href="https://twitter.com/OSTCompJam" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Twitter</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQwbeJG_5UmGBFxdYW4jylQ" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">YouTube</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://ostcompjam.bandcamp.com/" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Bandcamp</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://open.spotify.com/user/ebvw3phz7tsax2tvv54bvgjni" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Spotify</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://soundcloud.com/ostcompjam" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">SoundCloud</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.instagram.com/ostcompjam/" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Instagram</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://ko-fi.com/ostcompjam" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Ko-Fi</a></h4>
<p class="text-center"><a href="https://linktr.ee/ostcompjam" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Linktree</a></p>
